          "Lead on cost-of-living governance: at $65,318 income with 78.4% non-college-educated homeowners, property tax fairness, healthcare affordability, and utility cost management are the material concerns that anchor Republican support. Specific legislative wins on these issues—not abstract ideology—maintain the constituency's perception that the incumbent is delivering.",
