          "Actively engage the ~4.3% demographic gap in Census data; if this represents a Native American population, authentic constituent relationship-building is both a governance obligation and an electoral hedge against margin erosion.",
          "Address the 22.7% renter minority and younger adult voters directly on economic mobility and opportunity; the 80-20 margin leaves little room for a challenger to build if the incumbent writes off this constituency as unwinnable.",
          "Avoid treating the 80% result as a durable floor—it reflects current alignment with the homeowner majority, but any incumbent who neglects constituent service to the opposition's driving concerns or becomes identified with property-value-protection politics that alienates younger renters creates an opening for a credible challenger to move the margin downward."
