          "Engage Black and Hispanic communities with specific constituent attention: at 15.67% Black and 10.68% Hispanic in a below-median-income district, these communities face real economic mobility and healthcare access concerns that deserve targeted policy response and visible representation in constituent service, not generic outreach."
