          "Deliver measurable healthcare access improvements: at $48,545 median income with 50.6% renters, healthcare costs compete directly with rent and food for constrained household budgets; specific programs addressing primary-care access, prescription affordability, and preventive care reduce constituent economic pressure and build durable political support.",
