          "Address the 4.3% demographic gap and unaccounted population—likely including American Indian and mixed-race residents—with specific constituent engagement; unknown voting patterns in a 57-43 district mean unmobilized voter capacity exists, and authentic outreach builds institutional credibility while reducing challenger opportunity.",
